  "legalPrivacySummary": "所有数据都保留在您的设备上。我们不运营服务器，也不收集任何信息——没有账户、没有分析统计、没有标识符、没有崩溃报告。天气增强默认关闭，除非您开启；开启后，应用唯一的自动网络流量是访问 Open-Meteo.com，用于获取您创建的记录的大致位置（约 1 公里取整）和日期的天气。备份使用您手机自带的备份功能（Android 为 Google，iPhone 为 iCloud 或您的电脑），您可以在其设置中控制；导出文件会保存到您选择的位置。",
  "@legalPrivacySummary": {
    "description": "[legal] Privacy summary in About. Must stay as precise as the English: what is sent, to whom, and when. Keep 'Open-Meteo.com' as is."
  },
  "legalWeatherAttribution": "天气数据由 Open-Meteo.com 提供",
  "@legalWeatherAttribution": {
    "description": "[legal] Attribution required by Open-Meteo's CC-BY 4.0 licence. Keep 'Open-Meteo.com' as is."
  },
  "legalAppTitle": "Megrim：偏头痛记录",
  "@legalAppTitle": {
    "description": "Store-style title shown in About. Keep 'Megrim' untranslated."
  },
  "legalAppSubtitle": "离线偏头痛记录",
  "@legalAppSubtitle": {
    "description": "Store-style subtitle shown in About and on the Log screen."
  },
  "legalShortDescription": "私密的离线偏头痛记录，自动在设备端提供规律洞察。",
  "@legalShortDescription": {
    "description": "One-line description shown in About."
  },
  "legalFullDescription": "Megrim 是一款开源、离线优先的偏头痛日记，帮助您找到个人诱因。应用会自动为您的记录添加时间、季节、日照和月相信息（如果您选择加入，还会添加当地天气和气压），并完全在手机上计算相关性。没有账户、没有云服务器、零追踪，您的健康数据完全私密并由您掌控。",
  "@legalFullDescription": {
    "description": "Full description shown in About. Keep 'Megrim' untranslated."
  },
  "legalCaveatOddsRatioExplained": "OR = 比值比：在出现该因素的日子里，偏头痛的可能性高出多少。OR 2.0 ≈ 相对其他日子约两倍的可能性；OR 1.0 表示无影响。",
  "@legalCaveatOddsRatioExplained": {
    "description": "Caveat on the Suspected Factors card. 'OR' abbreviates the statistics term 'odds ratio'; use the usual abbreviation in your language if there is one, consistently."
  },
  "legalCaveatSmallSample": "小样本：基于有限偏头痛日的结果波动较大。",
  "@legalCaveatSmallSample": {
    "description": "Caveat on the Suspected Factors card."
  },
  "legalTranslationNote": "本翻译由志愿者完成。如果与医疗免责声明或隐私摘要的英文文本存在差异，以英文文本为准。",
